  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nExpression = (1-frac{5)/(8)div (24)/(63)times (24)/(63)}{1+(3)/(8)div (23)/(81)times (23)/(81)}=?\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nSimplify the numerator and denominator separately, then divide the numerator by the denominator.\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nNumerator:\n\n1 - (5)/(8)÷ (24)/(63)× (24)/(63)\n\n⇒ (5)/(8)÷ (24)/(63) = (5)/(8)× (63)/(24) = (5×63)/(8×24) = (315)/(192) \n\n⇒ (315)/(192)× (24)/(63) = (315×24)/(192×63) = (7560)/(12096) = (5)/(8)\n\n⇒ 1 - (5)/(8) = (8)/(8) - (5)/(8) = (3)/(8)\n\nDenominator:\n\n1 + (3)/(8)÷ (23)/(81)× (23)/(81)\n\n⇒ (3)/(8)÷ (23)/(81) = (3)/(8)× (81)/(23) = (3×81)/(8×23) = (243)/(184)\n\n⇒ (243)/(184)× (23)/(81) = (243×23)/(184×81) = (5589)/(14904) = (3)/(8)\n\n⇒ 1 + (3)/(8) = (8)/(8) + (3)/(8) = (11)/(8)\n\nFinal Expression:\n\n(Numerator)/(Denominator) = (frac{3)/(8)}{(11)/(8)}\n\n⇒ (3)/(8)÷ (11)/(8) = (3)/(8)× (8)/(11) = (3×8)/(8×11) = (3)/(11)\n\n**The correct answer is Option 4: (3)/(11) .**\n\n3b:Ta21,\n\n&l",
